/-!
# A340882

Irregular table: the n-th row polynomial is given by the formal power series expansion of Sum_{k >= 0} (1 + q)^(n*k + n^2)*Product_{j = 1..k} (1 - (1 + q)^(2*j-1)), n >= 1.

The 54 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A340882

